-- Consolidated baseline migration (squashed 2026-07-30).
--
-- Replaces 0001_sync_schema.sql .. 0009_checklist_groups_community_link.sql
-- (and several migrations applied directly to the live project with no
-- matching local file: harden_trigger_function_search_path,
-- boat_ownership_and_sharing, stale_warn_fix, stale_warn_add_column).
--
-- Generated by introspecting the live connected project directly (table
-- columns, RLS policies, functions, triggers, indexes, realtime publication
-- membership) rather than replaying the stale local files, per the
-- "no install base yet" policy in CLAUDE.md — schema history doesn't need to
-- preserve incremental back-compat migrations right now.
--
-- This file documents current reality; it is NOT re-executed against the
-- live project (which already has this exact schema) — only applied to a
-- fresh/local Supabase instance from here on.

